> Uhh, the 5305 was a "white box". Can you even install SRM on it?

Yup, Actually both AB and SRM are installed concurrently. It's only that
you cannot install Tru64/VMS from SRM console. There is no listing in their
respective kernels (lookup table) for 5305. Though you can change what SRM
reports as it's systype. It's well documented and I've seen it work before, That
is Tru64 running on a 'whitebox'.

