I have seen this too when I tried to use a high-speed fan.  I could not 
find any documentation on the RPM range required by the MB to consider 
the fan to be working properly.

On PC fan leads are: 1) black = ground, 2) red = +12 V and 3) white = 
tach.  On alpha leads are: 1) red = +12V, 2)green (?) = tach and 3) 
black = ground.

Don

