The patches can be found in the SRPM (source-RPM).  However,
it would not necessarily be a good thing to apply version 0.8.1
patches to 0.9.9 sources.

I wouldn't characterize it as the distribution causing
incompatibilities.  I would characterize it as Redhat
using patches to fix bugs they have found, in cases where
the fixes have not made it into the "regular" sources.

