Sigh, missed that typo; I meant "retail" as opposed to OEM. The cards
we DEC/COMPAQ sold were OEMed from ELSA, without S-Video connector,
but with a VGA-disable switch which facilitated multi-head support on
Alpha. The "retail" version (over-the-counter :-) had the S-Video but
no VGA-disable.

