Greetings Annesh,

Linus does not allow floating point in the kernel.  Please search the main 
kernel mailing list archives.  A link can be found at http://kernel.org This 
is an old debate that has been discussed on the lkml (Linux Kernel Mailing 
List) many times.  I do not believe that you will be able to change Linus's 
mind. 

Best Regards,


--George

