Look for as much info as you can when it comes to security and your new
wireless lan.  I have been with a few people who have done wireless scanning
in our city and from what I saw a lot of people have very insecure wireless
networks.  Think about what could happen if some dumb kiddie drives his car
around your house and is able to connect to your wireless network with his
laptop.  Not only could he access your local network he/she could aslo use
that wireless internet access to launch attacks on people and when they go
to see what happened it will all come back on you.  So when you get your
products for wireless lock em down and keep the kiddies out.

