I picked up a multia a year or so ago, thinking it would make a great
cheap access point.  I googled for days, and everything I read said it was
basically impossible to make a Multia/UDB play nice with a wireless
PCcard, unless you put NT on it.  So I would up getting a Linksys BEFW11S4
(WAP and 4 port router), which has been awesome since Linksys put out
decent firmware for it.  

I still have the multia and my Wavelan Bronze pc card though.  Could you
describe which distro (Redhat, I assume) you're using, and if you had to
go through any special or unusual configuration problems to get your
wireless card to work on the multia?  I would still like to set mine up,
so I can have wireless at home in addition to the dorm.  


Thanks
