ARGH... no...

DS20's / DP264's use a completely different design for the CPUs. in the
DS20/DP264 they are actually a daughter card that has an edge connector
as well as a seperate power connector to feed +5v and Ground to it. There
is also a seperate SROM connector on each daughter card. They are NOT
cross compatible. (I've been told that they will fit in each other's slots
but lots of smoke will result if you try it).

Kurt


