Doesn't sound like a power issue to me.  It sounds like heat.  Heat does
some pretty freaky stuff, causing mysterious lockups, reboots, and just
plain bizarre errors.  What is the airflow like in your case?  Is there
a way you can get more fresh air in and the hot and stale are out?

The good news about heat problems is that they are very easy and
inexpensive to fix.

Ted



