Eeewww... "little freedom".

I say "bollocks"
I have yet to hear a real problem with rpm, except maybe it is more 
complicated than some people are comfortable with..
Granted, it is a huge tool, with an awful lot of options..
Still, it pretty well has to be to accomplish what it does..

So, what thing is missing in rpm?
Or done wrongly.
Please understand, I am sure there is something wrong, except that I have 
not heard that yet..
But I am a simple minded person, so maybe I am missing lots of things.

>I understand this will be a huge undertaking.  In response to the
>comment that users need to contribute more, I fully agree.  Alpha seems
