Hi folks,

This could be good news. According to a leaked memo on The Inquirer
Microsoft *will* be producing a copy of 64bit Windows to run on Hammer.
See the links below.

http://www.theinquirer.net/23040208.htm

http://www.theinquirer.net/a_23040205.htm




There will even be a 32-64bit translation software like good ol Fx32. I
think this is good news. I know the mainstream will probably still run
Windows but if lots of people buy Hammers then it should be a real
performer.
 There is even a Linux - hammer mailing list that I've been subscribed to a
