The the list:

This whole discussionhas been pretty interesting.  I think I'll send
Debian a check, what the hell.  I've done it before, in one case to the
owner of a proprietary OS i got off an FTP site because the software had
been discontinued.  

I've given to the undeserving, at least Debian deserves some support..
In fact I might send money to some of the other open source orgs if i
can find their addresses.

As to the Deb: I've used Corel Linux a lot (on intel/AMD hardware), it's
Debian and it works pretty well if it likes the hardware it's on. 


"Thursday"




