Click View->Show/Hide->Sidebar to toggle it off/on.  It may also be
mapped to the F9 key.  You may also want to go into
Preferences->Navigator->Internet Search and clear the checkbox
"Open the search tab in the sidebar when search results are
available".

I don't know about the other issue.  I haven't tried it.
Are you using 0.9.9 or 1.0RC1?  If you're not using RC1
you may want to try it.  If it doesn't work there, then I
suggest that you open a issue in Bugzilla.

Alan

