I have a PWS433 and it takes PC100 (83.3Mhz or better) ECC Unbuffered 168
PIN SDRAM in matched pairs. Unless there is a great difference in the
motherboards. I'm certain the list will comment otherwise. THe PWS433 will
support up to 1.5GB on the motherboard officially. I don't have any
knowledge to suggest otherwise.

James

